{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations, contestant! You have been selected to compete in the 87th annual Luxengames! In no time you will enter the hippodrome, armed to fight through the fierce gauntlet ahead of you. Brave our fun, themed obstacle course and conquer our state of the art defense bots, and you might just have the chance at endless fame and fortune! Fail, however, and you will die a horrible death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luxenglobe is a visually-stunning first person arena shooter where you must battle robots with an electric shotgun and rifle. Platform and dodge both ranged and melee enemies in each escalating room until you win the prize. This short student project is a senior thesis project for Ringling College of Art and Design.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920480?t=1757722968","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920480/5cd858d928d76211a4834646a0ca820157a1a771/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757722968","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920480/81f76308c486d4044165830cb965780ae8e4d26a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757722968","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920480/81f76308c486d4044165830cb965780ae8e4d26a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757722968","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations, contestant! You have been selected to compete in the 87th annual Luxengames! In no time you will enter the hippodrome, armed to fight through the fierce gauntlet ahead of you. Brave our fun, themed obstacle course and conquer our state of the art defense bots, and you might just have the chance at endless fame and fortune! Fail, however, and you will die a ho